@startuml developer-data-flow
title Data pipeline, as a sequence\nSynthea to Neo4j, then the proxy to the UI
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

participant "Synthea" as SY
participant "Neo4j graph" as NEO
participant "neo4j-proxy\n:9090" as PROXY
participant "Next.js UI\n:3000" as UI

== Seeding ==
SY -> NEO : load_fhir_neo4j.py\n127 patients as FHIR R4
NEO -> NEO : fhir-to-omop-transform.cypher\nFHIR to OMOP CDM, MAPPED_TO
NEO -> NEO : CODED_BY to SNOMED, LOINC,\nRxNorm and ICD-10

== Serving ==
UI -> PROXY : /api/graph, /api/catalog, /nlq
PROXY -> NEO : parameterised Cypher
NEO --> PROXY : graph data
PROXY --> UI : JSON response
@enduml
